1864..1937 Comment "/// A relay sends the root the worker\'s peer, and the clause abandons the"
1938..2016 Comment "/// root\'s rest before it takes that end. The root\'s cancelled end cancels the"
2017..2097 Comment "/// end queued at it, and the worker\'s waiting receive then abandons the worker."
